spinner) is based on claude-skins (https://github.com/hellosverre/claude-skins),
commit cf0d39f, licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSES/MIT-claude-skins.txt):

  claude-skins
  Copyright (c) 2026 hellosverre

From claude-skins we took the shape of the render events (ToolUse, ToolResult,
Spinner, TurnDuration), the ▸ disclosure of a tool row, timing each call in
tool.call, following the theme through config.set, reading Bash and Edit
results (stdout/stderr, "Exit code N", structuredPatch) and the layout of the
diff and shell cards. The code itself is new. Files:
  hooks/skin.tsx, hooks/skin-kaarten.tsx
  lib/skin.mjs, lib/skin.d.mts, lib/skin-svg.mjs, lib/skin-svg.d.mts

